  "Chapter": "银河座　第4章",
  "Title": "一阳来复",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1030418001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那个……前辈，你听说了吗？/n关于沃尔芙前辈的传闻。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "690",
      "BgmFileName": "7",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是工作坊被禁止之后，/n她到处找后辈聊天的那件事？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "还真闲啊。/n有那时间，不如拿去排练。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呃、那个……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "怎么？你也想和别人抱团吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不、不是，我不是这个意思……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "大家，早上好——！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 18,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "与那国前辈！？/n……早、早上好。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "早、早上好，与那国前辈。/n今天早上感觉比平时还要干劲十足呢……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯！因为我决定把晨跑距离加长！/n那我出发啦——！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……与那国也真是的。/n明明越过大家拿到了重要角色，居然一点危机感都没有吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "前、前辈，别这么说……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我说的是事实吧。/n演得差到每天都被老师训――",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，对了对了！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "咿！？/n与、与那国，你已经回来了！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "拉莫让我带话！/n从今天起，她也会来找你们聊天！",
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180160",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 103,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "诶……？/n可我们并不是原工作坊的成员……",
      "BgmFileName": "201",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来参加过工作坊的人，她已经全都聊过了，/n所以下一步要去听听没参加过的人的想法。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 11,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "绯花里",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "有什么不满或者难受的事都尽管告诉她！/n好啦，话我确实带到了——！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180190",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 202,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 30503,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "305"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "SeFileName": "560",
      "CharacterMotions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊、啊……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我要不要鼓起勇气，去咨询一下杀阵的问题呢。/n要完全照老师说的那样活动身体，对我来说很难……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哼……就算商量、讲协作，演技也不会变好。/n我们所有人都是竞争对手。这才是银河座。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这套主张，就让我直接来听吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "咿！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "莉莉亚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "背后说人坏话，不美。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180250",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30403,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "304"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "沃、沃尔芙前辈和库尔特贝前辈……！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "把不满发泄到理念不合的人身上，/n只会让排练场的气氛越来越差。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180270",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "有什么想说的，先说给我听。/n这样多少能让你消消气吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180280",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……你是说，剑拔弩张不好？/n我们这里原本不就是这样的吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就算恢复到原来的气氛，也不代表会更舒服。/n反过来，甚至可能给演戏带来负面影响。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "如果因此让世界演剧联盟降低对整个银河座的评价呢？/n对我、对你们来说，不都是坏事吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180310",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "銀河座団員達",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "唔……",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就算思想和信念不同，/n至少不想毁掉下一场公演的心情，大家都是一样的吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我没说一定要和睦相处。/n但至少在度过这次难关之前，我希望大家别再互相拖后腿。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030418036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030418,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……怎么样？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10304180350",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30203,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
